  "notes": "{相関|そうかん} is primarily used in statistical and scientific contexts.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {相関|そうかん}がある: to have a correlation\n- {相関|そうかん}{関係|かんけい}: correlation, correlative relationship\n- {相関|そうかん}{係数|けいすう}: correlation coefficient\n- {正|せい}の{相関|そうかん}: positive correlation\n- {負|ふ}の{相関|そうかん}: negative correlation\n- {強|つよ}い / {弱|よわ}い{相関|そうかん}: strong / weak correlation\n\nWATCH OUT:\n{相関|そうかん}{関係|かんけい} does not imply causation ({因果|いんが}{関係|かんけい}).\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {関連|かんれん}: relation, connection (broader meaning)\n- {関係|かんけい}: relationship (general)",
